Third-party components keep their own licences:

- Pretendard-adjacent bundled webfont **Paperlogy** — SIL Open Font License 1.1.
  Full text at `static/fonts/OFL.txt`; attribution at `static/fonts/NOTICE.md`.
  The OFL governs those font files, not this MIT grant.
- The `ppt-master` pipeline under `.claude/skills/` is the work of Hugo He
  (MIT, per the copyright above), developed and adapted for Korean use at
  https://github.com/byungjunjang/slide-master. This repository now vendors it
  rather than importing it, under the same MIT terms. The pipeline's design —
  the source-to-SVG-to-PPTX route, the structured template contract, the
  three-stage confirmation flow and its recommendations.json -> result.json
  contract — is that project's, not this one's. WeDraw's additions are the
  confirm UI and the planning stage (intake, planner, storyline).
- The `decks/withby-green/` prototypes were ported from an existing 19-slide
  PPTX template; the original template's author is not recorded here yet.
